Obtained from the Lichess source repository (lichess-org/lila), where the
sound files are distributed under the GNU AGPL v3 (see lila's COPYING.md,
which lists the files covered by other licences; public/sound is not among
them, so the default AGPL applies).

The original .ogg/.mp3 files were converted to mono PCM .wav (22050 Hz) and
renamed to scidCommunity's move-sound names:

    Move       -> move, move_normal, move_castling, move_promotion
    Capture    -> move_capture
    Check      -> move_check, Check
    Checkmate  -> Mate

